  "settings.preferences.coaCount": { id: "{count} akun terdaftar", en: "{count} accounts registered", ms: "{count} akaun berdaftar", th: "ลงทะเบียนแล้ว {count} บัญชี", fil: "{count} account na nakarehistro", vi: "{count} tài khoản đã đăng ký" },
  "settings.preferences.coaButton": { id: "Kelola Chart of Account", en: "Manage Chart of Account", ms: "Urus Chart of Account", th: "จัดการ Chart of Account", fil: "I-manage ang Chart of Account", vi: "Quản lý hệ thống tài khoản" },
  "settings.preferences.shiftFloatHeading": { id: "Komposisi Modal Awal Shift", en: "Shift Opening Float Composition", ms: "Komposisi Modal Awal Syif", th: "องค์ประกอบเงินทุนเริ่มต้นกะ", fil: "Komposisyon ng Opening Float ng Shift", vi: "Thành phần vốn ban đầu ca làm việc" },
  "settings.preferences.shiftFloatDesc": { id: "Pilih akun kas mana saja yang dijumlahkan sebagai saran Modal Awal saat kasir buka shift baru — beda rental beda skala, jadi ini bisa disesuaikan: rental kecil mungkin cukup satu Kas Toko, rental besar bisa gabungkan Kas Toko + Kas Besar + Kas Kecil + Saldo Deposit sekaligus. Kalau tidak ada yang dicentang, saran Modal Awal memakai satu akun kas default outlet seperti biasa. Ini hanya SARAN angka — kasir tetap bisa mengubahnya sebelum submit.", en: "Pick which cash accounts get summed as the suggested Starting Cash when a cashier opens a new shift — every rental business is a different scale, so this is adjustable: a small one might only need one Store Cash pool, a larger one can combine Store Cash + Main Safe + Petty Cash + Deposit Balance all at once. If nothing is checked, the suggestion falls back to the outlet's single default cash account as before. This is only a SUGGESTED figure — the cashier can still change it before submitting.", ms: "Pilih akaun tunai mana yang dijumlahkan sebagai cadangan Modal Awal apabila juruwang membuka syif baharu — setiap perniagaan rental berbeza skala, jadi ini boleh disesuaikan: rental kecil mungkin cukup satu Kas Toko, rental besar boleh gabungkan Kas Toko + Kas Besar + Kas Kecil + Baki Deposit sekali gus. Jika tiada yang ditanda, cadangan Modal Awal guna satu akaun tunai default outlet seperti biasa. Ini hanya CADANGAN angka — juruwang masih boleh mengubahnya sebelum menghantar.", th: "เลือกบัญชีเงินสดที่จะรวมเป็นเงินทุนเริ่มต้นที่แนะนำเมื่อแคชเชียร์เปิดกะใหม่ — ธุรกิจเช่าแต่ละแห่งมีขนาดต่างกัน จึงปรับได้: ร้านเล็กอาจใช้แค่ Kas Toko เดียว ร้านใหญ่อาจรวม Kas Toko + Kas Besar + Kas Kecil + ยอดฝาก พร้อมกัน ถ้าไม่มีการติ๊กเลือก คำแนะนำจะใช้บัญชีเงินสดหลักเดียวของสาขาเหมือนเดิม นี่เป็นเพียงตัวเลข \"แนะนำ\" เท่านั้น — แคชเชียร์ยังแก้ไขได้ก่อนส่ง", fil: "Piliin kung aling mga cash account ang idadagdag bilang inirerekomendang Starting Cash kapag nagbukas ang cashier ng bagong shift — magkaiba ang scale ng bawat negosyong paupahan, kaya ito ay maaaring i-adjust: ang maliit na rental ay maaaring isang Store Cash lang, ang mas malaki ay maaaring pagsamahin ang Store Cash + Main Safe + Petty Cash + Deposit Balance nang sabay-sabay. Kung walang naka-check, babalik ang mungkahi sa iisang default cash account ng outlet gaya ng dati. Ito ay MUNGKAHING numero lamang — puwede pa itong baguhin ng cashier bago mag-submit.", vi: "Chọn các tài khoản tiền mặt nào sẽ được cộng làm gợi ý Vốn ban đầu khi thu ngân mở ca mới — mỗi cửa hàng cho thuê có quy mô khác nhau nên có thể tùy chỉnh: cửa hàng nhỏ có thể chỉ cần một quỹ Kas Toko, cửa hàng lớn có thể gộp Kas Toko + Két lớn + Quỹ nhỏ + Số dư ký quỹ cùng lúc. Nếu không chọn gì, gợi ý sẽ quay về một tài khoản tiền mặt mặc định của chi nhánh như trước. Đây chỉ là số GỢI Ý — thu ngân vẫn có thể thay đổi trước khi gửi." },
  "settings.preferences.shiftFloatEmpty": { id: "Belum ada akun kas terdaftar — tambahkan dulu di Admin Data > Akun Kas/Bank.", en: "No cash accounts registered yet — add one first in Admin Data > Cash/Bank Accounts.", ms: "Belum ada akaun tunai berdaftar — tambah dahulu di Admin Data > Akaun Tunai/Bank.", th: "ยังไม่มีบัญชีเงินสดที่ลงทะเบียน — เพิ่มก่อนที่ Admin Data > บัญชีเงินสด/ธนาคาร", fil: "Wala pang nakarehistrong cash account — magdagdag muna sa Admin Data > Cash/Bank Accounts.", vi: "Chưa có tài khoản tiền mặt nào được đăng ký — thêm trước tại Admin Data > Tài khoản Tiền mặt/Ngân hàng." },
  "settings.preferences.shiftFloatDefaultTag": { id: "default outlet", en: "outlet default", ms: "default outlet", th: "ค่าเริ่มต้นสาขา", fil: "default ng outlet", vi: "mặc định chi nhánh" },
  "settings.preferences.fraudHeading": { id: "Ambang Batas Anti-Fraud Shift", en: "Shift Anti-Fraud Thresholds", ms: "Ambang Anti-Fraud Syif", th: "เกณฑ์ป้องกันทุจริตของกะ", fil: "Mga Threshold ng Anti-Fraud sa Shift", vi: "Ngưỡng chống gian lận ca làm việc" },
  "settings.preferences.fraudDesc": { id: "Shift yang selisihnya atau jumlah void/refund/hapus-nya melebihi ambang ini otomatis ditandai untuk ditinjau Owner/Manager — lihat tab Approval di halaman Staf, atau langsung di halaman Shift. Tidak menghalangi kasir menutup shift, hanya menandai untuk ditinjau.", en: "A shift whose variance or void/refund/delete count exceeds this threshold is auto-flagged for Owner/Manager review — see the Approval tab on the Staff page, or directly on the Shift page. It never blocks the cashier from closing out, only flags it for review.", ms: "Syif yang perbezaan atau bilangan void/refund/padamnya melebihi ambang ini akan ditanda secara automatik untuk semakan Owner/Manager — lihat tab Approval di halaman Staf, atau terus di halaman Syif. Tidak menghalang kasier menutup syif, hanya menanda untuk semakan.", th: "กะที่มีผลต่างหรือจำนวนการยกเลิก/คืนเงิน/ลบเกินเกณฑ์นี้จะถูกตั้งค่าสถานะอัตโนมัติให้เจ้าของ/ผู้จัดการตรวจสอบ — ดูที่แท็บ Approval ในหน้าพนักงาน หรือที่หน้ากะโดยตรง ไม่ปิดกั้นแคชเชียร์จากการปิดกะ เพียงตั้งค่าสถานะให้ตรวจสอบเท่านั้น", fil: "Ang shift na ang variance o bilang ng void/refund/delete ay lumampas sa threshold na ito ay awtomatikong minamarkahan para sa review ng Owner/Manager — tingnan ang Approval tab sa pahina ng Staff, o direkta sa pahina ng Shift. Hindi nito hinahadlangan ang cashier na isara ang shift, minamarkahan lang ito para sa review.", vi: "Ca có chênh lệch hoặc số lần hủy/hoàn tiền/xóa vượt ngưỡng này sẽ tự động được gắn cờ để Chủ/Quản lý xem xét — xem tab Approval trên trang Nhân viên, hoặc trực tiếp trên trang Ca làm việc. Không chặn thu ngân đóng ca, chỉ đánh dấu để xem xét." },
